exports[`新しい DB を移行した後のスキーマ > 表・列・索引・制約・storage parameter がスナップショットのとおりで、移行を2回打っても変わらない > indexes 1`] = `
[
  "agent_token_active | agent_token_active_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX agent_token_active_pkey ON public.agent_token_active USING btree (id)",
  "agent_token_settings | agent_token_settings_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX agent_token_settings_pkey ON public.agent_token_settings USING btree (id)",
  "agent_tokens | agent_tokens_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX agent_tokens_pkey ON public.agent_tokens USING btree (id)",
  "approvals | approvals_conversation_id_idx | CREATE INDEX approvals_conversation_id_idx ON public.approvals USING btree (((approval ->> 'conversationId'::text)), created_at)",
  "approvals | approvals_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX approvals_pkey ON public.approvals USING btree (id)",
  "archive | archive_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX archive_pkey ON public.archive USING btree (id)",
  "archive | archive_session_at_idx | CREATE INDEX archive_session_at_idx ON public.archive USING btree (session_id, at)",
  "attachments | attachments_blob_key_idx | CREATE INDEX attachments_blob_key_idx ON public.attachments USING btree (blob_key) WHERE (blob_key IS NOT NULL)",
  "attachments | attachments_created_at_idx | CREATE INDEX attachments_created_at_idx ON public.attachments USING btree (created_at)",
  "attachments | attachments_expires_at_idx | CREATE INDEX attachments_expires_at_idx ON public.attachments USING btree (expires_at)",
  "attachments | attachments_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX attachments_pkey ON public.attachments USING btree (id)",
  "auth_access_tokens | auth_access_tokens_account_idx | CREATE INDEX auth_access_tokens_account_idx ON public.auth_access_tokens USING btree (account_id)",
  "auth_access_tokens | auth_access_tokens_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX auth_access_tokens_pkey ON public.auth_access_tokens USING btree (id)",
  "auth_access_tokens | auth_access_tokens_sha256_idx | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX auth_access_tokens_sha256_idx ON public.auth_access_tokens USING btree (sha256)",
  "auth_accounts | auth_accounts_email_lower_idx | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX auth_accounts_email_lower_idx ON public.auth_accounts USING btree (lower(email))",
  "auth_accounts | auth_accounts_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX auth_accounts_pkey ON public.auth_accounts USING btree (id)",
  "auth_identities | auth_identities_account_idx | CREATE INDEX auth_identities_account_idx ON public.auth_identities USING btree (account_id)",
  "auth_identities | auth_identities_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX auth_identities_pkey ON public.auth_identities USING btree (provider, subject)",
  "auth_login_requests | auth_login_requests_expires_idx | CREATE INDEX auth_login_requests_expires_idx ON public.auth_login_requests USING btree (expires_at)",
  "auth_login_requests | auth_login_requests_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX auth_login_requests_pkey ON public.auth_login_requests USING btree (id)",
  "codex_chatgpt_auth | codex_chatgpt_auth_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX codex_chatgpt_auth_pkey ON public.codex_chatgpt_auth USING btree (id)",
  "conversation_outbound_latest | conversation_outbound_latest_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX conversation_outbound_latest_pkey ON public.conversation_outbound_latest USING btree (conversation_id)",
  "conversation_read | conversation_read_pkey | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX conversation_read_pkey ON public.conversation_read USING btree (conversation_id)",
